{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/2025/0729/c36131a3072033/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:36.993390+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/2025/0729/c36131a3072033/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><span>欢迎各位优秀学子申请浙江大学经济学院</span><span>2026</span><span>年推荐免试研究生！具体事项说明如下：</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>请在浙江大学研究生招生服务系统中提交申请，我院申请时间：</span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日</span><span>09</span><span>：</span><span>00</span><span>至</span><strong><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span><span>17</span><span>：</span><span>00</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>申请条件、报名方式和流程等详见“浙江大学关于</span><span>2026</span><span>年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知”。网址：</span><span>http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2025/0728/c28479a3071793/page.htm</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>填报注意事项 ：</span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span>）在申请系统中提交以下材料（压缩成</span><span>1</span><span><span><span>个文件）：本人有效身份证扫描件（应为原件的扫描件，正反面在同一页，身份证截图无效）</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>个人照片，本科期间成绩单（须包含学校</span></span></span><span>/</span><span>学院相关部门盖章），成绩排名证明（特指所在学校确定免试推荐名额所依据的成绩排名，应注明名次和参加排名的总人数，须学校</span><span>/</span><span>学院相关部门盖章），外语水平证明（六级成绩单等），已发表的论文、获奖证书扫描件（论文、获奖合计不超过</span><span>6</span><span>项）。</span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span>）原则上成绩和排名应为前</span><span>6</span><span>个学期。如在申请截止日期前还没有出前</span><span>6</span><span>个学期的成绩及排名的，请提交前</span><span>5</span><span>学期的成绩和排名，并在备注中说明。</span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）申请直接攻读博士的考生，英语应符合以下条件：英语六级≥</span></span><span><span>500</span></span><span><span>分，成绩有效期为五年；或托福≥</span></span><span><span>90</span></span><span><span>分，或雅思≥</span></span><span><span>6.5</span></span><span><span>分，成绩有效期参照证书的有效期。此外，需按附件模板准备</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>封报考学科专业领域内的副高级及以上职称专家的书面推荐意见，并在复试资格审查</span></span><span><span>(</span></span><span><span>预计</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月中下旬，在此前准备好即可</span></span><span><span>)</span></span><span><span>时提供。</span></span></p><p><a href=\"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/2025/0729/c36131a3072033/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>4.</span><span>金融专硕中的金融科技（</span><span>iMF</span><span>）方向由浙大国际联合商学院（</span><span>ZIBS</span><span>）（海宁校区）负责招生、培养和管理。培养方案及相关信息请参见</span><span>ZIBS</span><span>网站：</span><span>zibs.zju.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>咨询邮箱：</span><span>sainanwang@zju.edu.cn</span><span>，咨询电话：</span><span>0571-88981625</span><span>。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/4c3b492ca5c48cbaed83.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/d1/27/bc52b6bb416e884ac4125e56c412/48f8a32a-b290-4c39-9177-5baeade9e55a.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件：专家推荐信.docx</a></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"085805cffe78dc4a576ebf9baf98c9ffe2b8e19b7ec803687a16760fe54cebe2","textLength":778,"sourceSha256":"6a81300651b999be006e90bf15a99ea7535a35a36eaee743216102cf1a8638a0","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9f8cac60a22b67b1c4ef","title":"2025年浙江大学经济学院关于2026年外校推荐免试生网上申请的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:36.993390+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/4c3b492ca5c48cbaed83.gif"}]}
